From b7606794f305c1e5c50da9565a64f583ba90ee09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 22:45:52 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] refactor(repo): add websocket heartbeat for live issues

Implement a heartbeat mechanism in the `issue-live` WebSocket connection
to improve stability and connection reliability. Added `ping`/`pong`
logic and improved SharedWorker reconnect handling.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
---
